{"nodes": [{"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/specification/validation-visible", "kind": "need", "label": "specification/validation-visible", "text": "A reviewer can see, at release, which user needs have no approved validation by a person."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/specification/scaffold-project", "kind": "need", "label": "specification/scaffold-project", "text": "A regulatory author can scaffold a new compliant documentation project from a single command."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/specification/adopt-repository", "kind": "need", "label": "specification/adopt-repository", "text": "An existing repository can be brought under RDM from a single command, without disturbing its current contents."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/risk/risk-register", "kind": "need", "label": "risk/risk-register", "text": "A team can keep its risk register in the record, each risk scored from its own matrix and each control a verified requirement, and cannot release while a risk is unscored, uncontrolled, or residually unacceptable without a named acceptance."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/release/trace-verification", "kind": "need", "label": "release/trace-verification", "text": "Each requirement's verification status is traceable from executed test results."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/release/release-evidence", "kind": "need", "label": "release/release-evidence", "text": "A release's evidence (verification data, traceability matrix, verification report) and the device-master-record index can be produced as retained, generated artifacts from the record."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/release/release-blocked", "kind": "need", "label": "release/release-blocked", "text": "A release is blocked until every requirement of the spec is verified by a passing test."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/publishing/user-manual", "kind": "need", "label": "publishing/user-manual", "text": "A user learns from RDM's user manual, a controlled document of each release, how to keep the record the way that release's gates enforce."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/publishing/compile-dhf", "kind": "need", "label": "publishing/compile-dhf", "text": "A regulatory author can compile a design history file from the system of record: the spec, the executed tests and git."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/graph/explore-graph", "kind": "need", "label": "graph/explore-graph", "text": "A regulatory author can query and visually explore the record as a linked graph, without changing how the record is written."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/graph/agent-reads-record", "kind": "need", "label": "graph/agent-reads-record", "text": "An agent, in any harness, can read the record (query it, trace a requirement or need to its tests and results, check it against the gate rules) and cannot change it."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:need/compliance/gap-analysis", "kind": "need", "label": "compliance/gap-analysis", "text": "A regulatory author can check that documents contain the references a chosen standard's checklist requires (gap analysis)."}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-07-010", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-07-010", "text": "Each branch's manual is published as a hidden preview, removed with the branch", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/publishing"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-07-009", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-07-009", "text": "The verification report shows a reviewer who did not run the tests what was verified", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/publishing"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-07-008", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-07-008", "text": "The DMR index has one entry per controlled document, from its frontmatter", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/publishing"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-07-007", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-07-007", "text": "The manual's \"Limits and risks\" chapter discloses every risk of the register by its id", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/publishing"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-07-006", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-07-006", "text": "The manual is published once per release tag and once for the development version", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/publishing"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-07-005", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-07-005", "text": "IFU-001 lists the manual's pages in the reading order of instructions for use, behind a cover", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/publishing"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-07-004", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-07-004", "text": "The lines between RDOC and ENDRDOC are a snippet under its key", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/publishing"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-07-003", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-07-003", "text": "Sections are numbered, a second render gets the first's words, and auditor-only notes are removed", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/publishing"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-07-002", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-07-002", "text": "invert_dependencies, join_to, md_indent, glob, include and gherkin build traceability tables and final documents", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/publishing"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-07-001", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-07-001", "text": "rdm render fills a Markdown template from data files, each under its file name", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/publishing"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-016", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-016", "text": "Each run links to the commit it tested, and a run of another commit than the product's is stale", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-015", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-015", "text": "Contexts link to the documents that declare them, and documents to the ones they reference", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-014", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-014", "text": "A result is projected in full, but not what claims nothing about design controls", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-013", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-013", "text": "A run's steps and attachments are in the graph and in trace", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-012", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-012", "text": "A risk links to the document of the policy it was evaluated against", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-011", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-011", "text": "A document's latest change is recorded with the commit that landed it on the default branch", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-010", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-010", "text": "rdm graph validate reports each result and exits on a violation", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-009", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-009", "text": "A document's reference tags link it to the clauses rdm gap would match", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-008", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-008", "text": "Each risk's facts are in the risks graph, and the shapes block the risks the gate blocks", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-007", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-007", "text": "The agent server cannot change the record or reach the network", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-006", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-006", "text": "The agent server answers schema, query, trace and validate from the current record", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-005", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-005", "text": "The whole record is written as a Graph Explorer file, a class left out on request", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-004", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-004", "text": "The shapes block exactly what the release gate blocks, each finding on its node", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-003", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-003", "text": "A text checklist, a built-in one and an RDF one become SKOS collections of clauses", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-002", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-002", "text": "The store is replaced on each build, queried with SPARQL and served read-only", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-06-001", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-06-001", "text": "A committed record becomes a dataset of named graphs, byte-identical while the record is unchanged", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-05-004", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-05-004", "text": "RDM's own document-control statement passes the built-in Part 11 checklist, and fails without a control", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/compliance"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-05-003", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-05-003", "text": "The coverage report gives each checklist's total, missing, covered and percent", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/compliance"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-05-002", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-05-002", "text": "The built-in checklists are listed by name, hold unique keys and resolve their includes", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/compliance"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-05-001", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-05-001", "text": "Gap analysis names each missing reference and exits non-zero when one is missing or nothing was checked", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/compliance"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-04-004", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-04-004", "text": "The reusable workflow and the gates action run RDM's gates at the revision the caller pins", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/release"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-04-003", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-04-003", "text": "The evidence bundle holds the verification data, the rendered matrix, the report and the results", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/release"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-04-002", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-04-002", "text": "Verified, failed and untested come from the runs that carry each requirement's id", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/release"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-04-001", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-04-001", "text": "The release gate passes only when every requirement has a passing run and none fails", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/release"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-03-003", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-03-003", "text": "executor.json and environment.properties name the executor and the environment", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/test_evidence"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-03-002", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-03-002", "text": "The pytest plugin labels each run of a claiming test with the commit under test", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/test_evidence"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-03-001", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-03-001", "text": "An unreadable result blocks release and is named, and a failed step fails its run", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/test_evidence"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-02-003", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-02-003", "text": "An unevaluated, unacceptable or unaccepted residual blocks release; a proposed rating only warns", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/risk"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-02-002", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-02-002", "text": "A register or policy that cannot be evaluated as written blocks release, naming the risk or the document", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/risk"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-02-001", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-02-001", "text": "Every field of a risk is read, and its levels come only from the declared risk policy", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/risk"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-01-005", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-01-005", "text": "A need is a Feature by default, or an event-model screen with its Allium surfaces and storm events", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/specification"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-01-004", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-01-004", "text": "The release gate warns of each user need without an approved validation record", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/specification"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-01-003", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-01-003", "text": "rdm adopt lays down the DHF skeleton and the CI gates, skipping what exists", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/specification"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-01-002", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-01-002", "text": "rdm init scaffolds a project that builds offline, and refuses a directory that exists", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/specification"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:requirement/item-01-001", "kind": "requirement", "label": "item-01-001", "text": "Every tagged scenario is a requirement, wherever the spec's layout keeps it", "owner": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/specification"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/test_evidence", "kind": "context", "label": "test_evidence"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/specification", "kind": "context", "label": "specification"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/risk", "kind": "context", "label": "risk"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/release", "kind": "context", "label": "release"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/publishing", "kind": "context", "label": "publishing"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/graph", "kind": "context", "label": "graph"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:context/compliance", "kind": "context", "label": "compliance"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:risk/RISK-TOOL-010", "kind": "risk", "label": "RISK-TOOL-010", "text": "The gate decides on results that are not the evidence of the commit being released.", "level": "Medium", "decision": "acceptable", "category": "safety"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:risk/RISK-TOOL-009", "kind": "risk", "label": "RISK-TOOL-009", "text": "The evidence that a release was verified cannot be retrieved later.", "level": "Medium", "decision": "accepted", "category": "safety"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:risk/RISK-TOOL-008", "kind": "risk", "label": "RISK-TOOL-008", "text": "The spec is read short: requirements are left out and no one notices.", "level": "High", "decision": "acceptable", "category": "safety"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:risk/RISK-TOOL-007", "kind": "risk", "label": "RISK-TOOL-007", "text": "A read-only query can make RDM send network requests.", "level": "Medium", "decision": "acceptable", "category": "security"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:risk/RISK-TOOL-006", "kind": "risk", "label": "RISK-TOOL-006", "text": "The served graph accepts SPARQL updates from any web origin.", "level": "Medium", "decision": "acceptable", "category": "security"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:risk/RISK-TOOL-005", "kind": "risk", "label": "RISK-TOOL-005", "text": "A test that claims a requirement passes without checking everything its scenario states.", "level": "High", "decision": "accepted", "category": "safety"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:risk/RISK-TOOL-004", "kind": "risk", "label": "RISK-TOOL-004", "text": "An agent changes the controlled record through RDM without review.", "level": "High", "decision": "acceptable", "category": "security"}, {"id": "urn:dhf:rdm:risk/RISK-TOOL-002", "kind": "risk", "label": "RISK-TOOL-002", "text": "The release gate passes a requirement whose test failed or never ran.", "level": "High", "decision": "acceptable", "category": "safety"}, {"id": "test:test_agent_server_answers_from_the_current_record", "kind": "test", "label": "test_agent_server_answers_from_the_current_record", "status": "passed"}, {"id": "test:test_the_docs_are_published_